<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#113d35">
<meta name="description" content="Christmas Toy Drive 24/7/365 original giving catalog: 31 proposed donation levels for toys, clothing, food, family essentials and year-round support.">
<title>Give Year-Round | Christmas Toy Drive Catalog</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--dark:#092d27;--green:#15473a;--pine:#27634e;--gold:#f4d795;--copper:#ae6650;--cream:#faf8ef;--paper:#fffefb;--border:#c9d9cd;--muted:#53675e;--ink:#0e342a}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}a{color:inherit}button,input,select{font:inherit}button,a,select{outline-offset:3px}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--copper)}.wrap{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px}header{background:var(--dark);color:white}header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;padding-top:17px;padding-bottom:17px}header a{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}header nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:13px}h1{font-size:clamp(41px,6vw,77px);letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.04;margin:15px 0 25px}h2{font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,43px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 15px}h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:21px}.hero{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 15%,#377b61,transparent 45%),linear-gradient(125deg,#174c3d,#092d27);color:white;padding:85px 0 80px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.19em;font-weight:900;color:var(--gold)}.hero .lede{font-size:19px;max-width:700px;color:#d7e8df;margin:0 0 25px}.buttons{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.btn{border:1px solid #2e6854;background:var(--green);color:white;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 17px;min-height:46px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.btn.gold{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--dark)}.btn.secondary{color:var(--green);background:white;border-color:#a6bdb0}.section{padding:64px 0}.sub{max-width:820px;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin:24px 0 0}.category{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;padding:26px}.symbol{font-size:31px;display:block;margin-bottom:14px}.category p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.planner{background:#eaf0e7;border-block:1px solid var(--border)}.planner-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(290px,.85fr);gap:21px;margin-top:24px;align-items:start}.pane{background:var(--paper);padding:27px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--border)}label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin:14px 0 6px}select{display:block;width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #91af9e;color:var(--ink);padding:13px;border-radius:10px;min-height:48px}.small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.preview{background:var(--green);color:#fff}.preview .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.preview h3{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,39px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:14px 0}.preview .money{font-size:49px;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-weight:900;margin:12px 0}.preview p{color:#e1f1e7;font-size:14px}.notice{padding:16px 18px;background:#fff4de;border-left:4px solid #b87842;color:#684929;margin-top:20px;border-radius:7px;font-size:14px}.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;margin-top:25px}table{border-collapse:collapse;min-width:740px;width:100%;font-size:14px}th{background:var(--green);color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:15px 13px;position:sticky;top:0}td{padding:12px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e8df;background:var(--paper)}tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#f5f8f2}td:first-child{font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap}td button{border:0;background:none;color:#0f6049;text-align:left;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;padding:4px}td button:hover{color:#973f2b}.check{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:15px;margin:25px 0}.check article{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:23px}.check p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0;font-size:14px}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:23px 0}.step{padding:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px}.step b{color:#8f533f;font-size:13px}.step strong{display:block;margin:8px 0}.step p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.footer{background:var(--dark);color:#dfefe6;padding:35px 0;font-size:13px}.footer a{color:var(--gold)}@media(max-width:820px){.three,.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.planner-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:550px){.wrap{padding:0 16px}.three,.check,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section{padding:45px 0}.hero{padding:65px 0}header nav{gap:10px}.pane{padding:20px}}@media print{header,.hero,.buttons,.planner,.footer{display:none}table{min-width:0;font-size:11px}.section{padding:10px 0}.tablewrap{overflow:visible}}
</style>
<script defer src="./catalog-data.js"></script>
<script defer src="./catalog-app.js"></script>
</head><body>
<header><div class="wrap"><a href="../">🎄 CHRISTMAS TOY DRIVE · 24 / 7 / 365</a><nav aria-label="Navigation"><a href="../">Main mission</a><a href="../give/">Cash App giving</a><a href="../../sites/">All websites</a><a href="../../nathan-ai/">Nathan AI</a></nav></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Original giving catalog · Every season · Every generation</div><h1>One gift today.<br>A giving movement<br>all year long.</h1><p class="lede">Choose toys, clothing, food or family essentials. Explore 31 proposed donation levels, plan one-time or ongoing support and connect with the Christmas Toy Drive's single giving gateway.</p><div class="buttons"><a href="#builder" class="btn gold">Choose a giving level</a><a href="#matrix" class="btn">Compare every level</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Three core missions. One connected drive.</h2><p class="sub">Your giving choices retain distinct purposes. Funds and goods must be logged and accounted for separately from the point of receipt through verified distribution.</p><div class="three">
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🎁</span><h3>Toys & learning</h3><p>Books, toys, puzzles, art, creative play, sports and age-appropriate educational experiences.</p><a href="#builder">Support toys →</a></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🧥</span><h3>Clothing & warmth</h3><p>Coats, schoolwear, shoes, socks and seasonal clothing that fits the recipient's needs.</p><a href="#builder">Support clothing →</a></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🥫</span><h3>Food & meals</h3><p>Pantry staples, groceries and meals coordinated with suitable food-distribution partners.</p><a href="#builder">Support food →</a></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section planner" id="builder"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#2c7055">Build your giving intention</div><h2>Choose exactly what you want to support.</h2><p class="sub">Select a program, level and schedule. This builder does not charge money, reserve inventory, create a subscription, collect an email address or certify payment.</p>
<div class="planner-grid"><div class="pane">
<label for="program">Giving category</label><select id="program"><option value="toys">Toys & Learning</option><option value="clothing">Clothing & Warmth</option><option value="food">Food & Meals</option><option value="essentials">Family Essentials</option><option value="logistics">Transport & Distribution</option><option value="mostneeded">Where Needed Most</option></select>
<label for="amount">Donation level</label><select id="amount"></select>
<label for="frequency">Giving frequency</label><select id="frequency"><option value="once">One-time giving plan</option><option value="monthly">Monthly giving intention (manual until connected)</option><option value="yearly">Annual giving intention (manual until connected)</option></select>
<p class="small">Selecting monthly or annual does not create an automatic recurring charge. The Cash App link does not automatically carry your chosen amount or category.</p>
</div>
<div class="pane preview" aria-live="polite"><div class="eyebrow">Your proposed giving selection</div><div class="money" id="chosen-amount">$50</div><h3 id="chosen-title">Play Bundle Fund</h3><p id="chosen-desc">Support the selected giving program.</p><p id="chosen-frequency">One-time giving plan</p><div class="buttons"><a class="btn gold" id="give-link" href="../give/">Continue to giving gateway</a><button type="button" id="copy-plan" class="btn">Copy giving plan</button></div><p id="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Planning only. Not a paid receipt or guaranteed quantity of goods.</p></div>
</div><div class="notice"><strong>Giving and tax status:</strong> Levels are proposed fundraising amounts, not item price guarantees. No automatic monthly billing or email receipt is connected. Tax-deductible nonprofit status has not been verified for this initiative, and the donor should independently confirm the Cash App recipient before paying.</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="matrix"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#2b6b51">31 donation levels · 93 category programs</div><h2>From the first $5 to community-scale gifts.</h2><p class="sub">Every dollar figure is a suggested contribution to a mission rather than a promised delivery of a particular bundle. Select any title in the matrix to load it into the giving planner.</p>
<div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Level</th><th scope="col">🎁 Toys</th><th scope="col">🧥 Clothing</th><th scope="col">🥫 Food</th></tr></thead><tbody id="matrix-rows"><tr><td colspan="4">Loading giving catalog…</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="giving-circle"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#2b6b51">The 365 Giving Circle · Ongoing intentions</div><h2>Small contributions. Every month. Year-round care.</h2><p class="sub">Each club represents an optional monthly giving intention. These buttons prepare a giving plan only; they do not schedule payments, create subscriptions or collect money.</p><div class="three">
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">✨</span><h3>Little Spark · $5/mo</h3><p>A starting commitment to the Toys & Learning fund.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-monthly="5" data-category="toys">Plan this support</button></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🧤</span><h3>Warm Hands · $10/mo</h3><p>An ongoing intention for clothing and cold-weather essentials.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-monthly="10" data-category="clothing">Plan this support</button></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🥫</span><h3>Pantry Promise · $20/mo</h3><p>Regular support for groceries and food assistance.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-monthly="20" data-category="food">Plan this support</button></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">❤️</span><h3>Family Circle · $30/mo</h3><p>Flexible giving for family essentials and necessities.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-monthly="30" data-category="essentials">Plan this support</button></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🎁</span><h3>Every Month Matters · $50/mo</h3><p>Continual support for toys, learning and holiday gifts.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-monthly="50" data-category="toys">Plan this support</button></article>
<article class="category"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true">🤝</span><h3>Community Builder · $100/mo</h3><p>Where Needed Most, according to transparent allocation policies.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-monthly="100" data-category="mostneeded">Plan this support</button></article>
</div><p class="small">Automatic monthly payments, donor accounts and email receipts require a verified payment processor and private email backend. Those systems are not activated here.</p></div></section>
<section class="section" style="background:#e9eee5"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#2b6b51">Beyond the three categories</div><h2>Supporting the full cycle of giving.</h2><div class="check">
<article><h3>🧼 Family essentials</h3><p>Diapers, hygiene products, bedding, school supplies and other verified necessities.</p></article>
<article><h3>🚚 Logistics & delivery</h3><p>Transport, packaging, storage, safety checks and distribution supplies.</p></article>
<article><h3>🤝 Where needed most</h3><p>Flexible support across approved programs, subject to transparent allocation policies.</p></article>
<article><h3>🏫 Group, workplace & matching campaigns</h3><p>Schools, churches, employers and community partners can organize drives. Any matching pledge must be verified before being advertised.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Year-round, not just December.</h2><div class="steps">
<div class="step"><b>JAN–MAR</b><strong>Winter warmth & meals</strong><p>Coats, essential clothing, household basics and ongoing pantry support.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>APR–JUN</b><strong>Spring essentials & learning</strong><p>Play, reading, clothing refreshes and healthy food distribution.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>JUL–SEP</b><strong>School-ready giving</strong><p>Schoolwear, supplies, age-appropriate learning tools and food support.</p></div>
<div class="step"><b>OCT–DEC</b><strong>Christmas & holiday drive</strong><p>Toy wishlists, clothing, groceries, gift cards and community events.</p></div>
</div><p class="sub">Donor acknowledgment, optional tribute cards and distribution reporting become automatic only when a privacy-protecting backend, email provider, inventory and payment verification are operational.</p></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap"><strong>CHRISTMAS TOY DRIVE · 24 / 7 / 365</strong><p>Original giving catalog created for the independent Nathan Tabor initiative. Inspiration: the structure of charitable gift catalogs, including Heifer International; no partnership, endorsement or affiliation is claimed.</p><a href="../">Drive home</a> · <a href="../give/">Giving gateway</a> · <a href="../../sites/">All websites</a></div></footer>
</body></html>